    "name_raw": "Urban Forager",
    "definition_type_raw": null,
    "source_book_raw": "Pathfinder Companion: Taldor, Echoes of Glory",
    "definition_raw": "You are skilled at keeping yourself and others safe in the alleys, sewers, and underbellies of cities.\n\nPrerequisites: Knowledge (Local) 4 ranks, Survival 4 ranks\n\nBenefit: You may use the Survival skill to forage and track in urban locations using the following table:\n\nDCTask10Get along in an urban setting, and easily find enough food and supplies to survive for 24 hours. You can provide food and water for one other person for every 2 points by which your check result exceeds 10.15Gain a +2 bonus on all Constitution checks made to resist starvation or thirst. You may grant the same bonus to one other character for every 1 point by which your Survival check exceeds 15.15Gain a +2 bonus on all Survival checks made to track on firm or hard ground.",
